## Build Commands

```bash
# Configure
cmake -B build -G "Unix Makefiles" -DKYR_BUILD_TESTS=ON -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug

# Build
cmake --build build -j2

# Test
ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure
```

## Key Decisions

- Physics uses flat arrays (not ECS) for simplicity in early phase
- SAP only sweeps X-axis for broadphase (Y/Z axes deferred)
- GJK/EPA deferred to later in P3; basic sphere/sphere SAT kept as fallback
- CI targets ubuntu-latest, windows-latest, macos-latest with GCC/Clang/MSVC
